'''Roki''' (ロキ, ''ROKI'') is a [[song]] by [[mikitoP]], covered by {{ColorLink|Miku}} alongside {{ColorLink|Ichika}} from the unit {{ColorLink|ln}}. This song became playable on September 30, 2020. Players unlock this song by default upon starting the game.

The full-length version of the SEKAI cover was released on the {{ColorLink|Ln||Leo/need SEKAI ALBUM vol.1}} on May 11, 2022. {{ColorLink|Len}} and {{ColorLink|KAITO}}'s full duet Another Vocal cover was also released on the {{ColorLink|VS||Vocal Album - VIRTUAL SINGER}} collection.

